    "Embedded Software Engineer with over two years of combined professional software-development and engineering experience spanning embedded systems, industrial communication, operational technology, IoT, networking, backend software, applications, and hardware-software integration.": "Embedded Software Engineer met meer dan twee jaar gecombineerde professionele software- en engineeringervaring in embedded systemen, industriële communicatie, operationele technologie, IoT, netwerken, backendsoftware, applicaties en hardware-software-integratie.",
    "Message construction, parsing, validation, reads, writes, answers, acknowledgements, and data conversion.": "Berichtopbouw, parsing, validatie, reads, writes, antwoorden, acknowledgements en dataconversie.",
    "Binary structures, bitfields, BCD encoding, bin8, bcd6, and bcd8.": "Binaire structuren, bitfields, BCD-encoding, bin8, bcd6 en bcd8.",
    "IFSF, LonWorks, LonTalk, TP/FT-10, forecourt technology, Price Poles, product data, pricing, and fuelling modes.": "IFSF, LonWorks, LonTalk, TP/FT-10, forecourttechnologie, Price Poles, productdata, prijzen en fuelling modes.",
    "C++11 compatibility and 32-bit Windows development using CMake, Ninja, GCC, and MinGW.": "C++11-compatibiliteit en 32-bit Windows-ontwikkeling met CMake, Ninja, GCC en MinGW.",
    "Debugging across embedded hardware, industrial devices, LON networks, REST services, and backend applications.": "Debugging over embedded hardware, industriële apparaten, LON-netwerken, REST-services en backendapplicaties.",
    "Implemented IFSF reads, writes, answer messages, ACK messages, message construction, parsing, encoding, and data conversion.": "Implementeerde IFSF-reads, writes, antwoordberichten, ACK-berichten, berichtopbouw, parsing, encoding en dataconversie.",
    "Worked with IFSF database structures and protocol-specific representations.": "Werkte met IFSF-databasestructuren en protocolspecifieke representaties.",
    "Used OpenRetailing simulators to generate Price Pole API payloads and IFSF simulators to receive and respond to Price Pole messages over LON.": "Gebruikte OpenRetailing-simulators om Price Pole API-payloads te genereren en IFSF-simulators om Price Pole-berichten via LON te ontvangen en te beantwoorden.",
    "Technical and project work covered C, C++, C#, Java, JavaScript, Python, Kotlin, embedded programming, Arduino, ESP32, TCP/IP, socket programming, IoT, desktop software, web/full-stack development, Android, machine learning, software engineering, and hardware-software integration.": "Technisch en projectwerk omvatte C, C++, C#, Java, JavaScript, Python, Kotlin, embedded programming, Arduino, ESP32, TCP/IP, socketprogrammering, IoT, desktopsoftware, web/full-stackontwikkeling, Android, machine learning, software engineering en hardware-software-integratie.",
    "Advanced programming, Python, quantitative programming, financial-data analysis, machine-learning fundamentals, Jupyter Notebook, algorithms, data processing, and research replication formed the technical core of the study-abroad year. Alongside the Computer Science programme, completed Korean Language Institute Levels 1 and 2.": "Advanced programming, Python, kwantitatief programmeren, financiële-data-analyse, machine-learningfundamenten, Jupyter Notebook, algoritmen, dataverwerking en onderzoeksreplicatie vormden de technische kern van het study-abroadjaar. Naast het Computer Science-programma zijn Korean Language Institute Levels 1 en 2 afgerond.",
